+//  - bits 11 ..  8 encodes the number of bits (depth) in the 2nd channel.
+//  - bits  7 ..  4 encodes the number of bits (depth) in the 1st channel.
+//  - bits  3 ..  0 encodes the number of bits (depth) in the 0th channel.
